WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.776
An AMD graphics

00:00:01.588 --> 00:00:02.566
card just got

00:00:02.378 --> 00:00:03.298
much faster at

00:00:03.109 --> 00:00:03.663
AI

00:00:04.182 --> 00:00:04.948
A lean

00:00:04.972 --> 00:00:06.009
small patch set

00:00:05.821 --> 00:00:07.271
applies AMD-specific

00:00:07.083 --> 00:00:08.309
improvements on top

00:00:08.121 --> 00:00:09.335
of llama cpp

00:00:09.524 --> 00:00:10.125
and it is

00:00:09.937 --> 00:00:10.998
re-applied to every

00:00:10.809 --> 00:00:11.623
new version

00:00:12.142 --> 00:00:13.002
On the author's

00:00:12.814 --> 00:00:13.639
own setup

00:00:13.817 --> 00:00:14.889
prefill jumped from

00:00:14.701 --> 00:00:15.998
about seven hundred

00:00:15.809 --> 00:00:17.083
to thirteen hundred

00:00:16.894 --> 00:00:18.038
tokens a second

00:00:18.566 --> 00:00:20.028
Token generation rose

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:20.358
too

00:00:20.524 --> 00:00:21.761
from thirty-five to

00:00:21.573 --> 00:00:22.823
fifty-five tokens a

00:00:22.634 --> 00:00:23.283
second

00:00:23.448 --> 00:00:24.391
with a ready-made

00:00:24.203 --> 00:00:25.464
container image to

00:00:25.276 --> 00:00:26.301
run it yourself

00:00:26.838 --> 00:00:27.852
Full story on

00:00:27.663 --> 00:00:28.559
the dashboard
